      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally don't have much that owner can do and no one else can, but even simple things like \"Can always manage the video player\" would be nice. Right now, if there is no instance owner I record the first person to join and they at the only one with override power for the duration of the instance. This would give additional options.",
