      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df0d6ebc352b44adaceac1|full_name} \n\nI have also considered \"First player to join\" but I have always hated The Event Portal Ritual where everybody must wait 20 seconds to ensure the host has loaded first. This should be a non-issue, but we're forced to deal with these awful workarounds.\n\nExisting methods also cannot account for group members with \"Instance Moderator\" permission, which my use case needs desperately.",
