  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-30T06:26:35.240Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "gets if local player is has moderation perms (ie: world creator, instance creator, group moderator).\n\nI want my moderator room to available to members of any group that visits my world, as opposed to a static whitelist which unfairly favors my group's moderators\n\n(for clarification: by \"moderator room\" I mean \"a small private meeting room used by moderators to have private conversations without having to leave the instance\")",
